        "dependent_variable_mapping.descr": "Two strings representing the values used to map to 0 (absence) and 1 (presence) for binary regression. By default, 0 and 1 will be used. For example, to predict an arrest with field values of Arrest and No Arrest, enter No Arrest for False Value (0) and Arrest for True Value (1).",
